invalid type: string "State S3 (Stage 2 Filling - Booster):\r\nIf the high-level sensor Hi_1 is not reached after 10 seconds, the system transitions to S3 (Transition T23).\r\nAt S3, both Pump 1 and Pump 2 operate simultaneously for rapid filling.\r\nStop Filling: When the Hi_1 sensor is activated, the system exits the filling state and transitions to the next phase.\r\nC. Tank 2 Filling Logic\r\n